<Project>
  <!--
    Central package management is enabled before dependencies are admitted. This bootstrap intentionally
    uses only framework/BCL references, so there is no NuGet package graph to lock yet. Add each external
    dependency here only after its license, security, and architectural role are reviewed; that task must
    also introduce and commit the applicable NuGet lock file for executable roots.

    Review note (2026-08-07): Microsoft.Data.Sqlite 10.0.10 was evaluated for the M1 registry/lock port
    but rejected because its transitive SQLitePCLRaw.lib.e_sqlite3 <= 2.1.11 carries the known high-severity
    CVE-2025-6965 (SQLite < 3.50.2, GHSA-2m69-gcr7-jv3q) with no patched release. The M1 state store is
    therefore implemented dependency-free (BCL only); SQLite remains the locked SP02 persistence decision,
    pending a patched provider.
  -->
  <ItemGroup />
</Project>
